<mxCell id="c26" value="Endpoint slower than 35 ms or&lt;br&gt;an error: use the rules-only&lt;br&gt;policy. Approve low-value,&lt;br&gt;step up the rest with 3-D&lt;br&gt;Secure, emit fallback_used.&lt;br&gt;Alarm if it covers more than&lt;br&gt;0.5% of traffic for 5 minutes." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="632" width="195" height="107" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
